The problem with making a Nethack bot as opposed to say an Angband bot is
Nethack has a huge number of variables to take into account. From the big,
what do I wish for? To the small do I read the scroll of teleport or drop
the scroll of scare monster or read the blessed scroll of earth. There are
so many rules and exceptions that it would be extrodinaraly complex.



